# The ONNX Runtime files under public/wasm/ are copied verbatim out of
# node_modules by scripts/copy-ort-wasm.cjs, which writes them byte for byte
# (LF). A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true converts the .mjs/.js ones to
# CRLF, so every `npm ci` left four tracked files reported as modified with an
# empty diff. Exempt the whole tree from end-of-line conversion: these are
# generated runtime assets, and the .wasm files are binary regardless.
public/wasm/** -text
